{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32509","headline":"长安旅舍纾情投先达 · 刘驾","name":"长安旅舍纾情投先达","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岐路不在地，马蹄徒苦辛。\n上国闻姓名，不如山中人。\n大宅满六街，此身入谁门。\n愁心日散乱，有似空中尘。\n白露下长安，百虫鸣草根。\n方当秋赋日，却忆归山村。\n静女头欲白，良媒况我邻。\n无令苦长叹，长叹销人魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32509.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32509","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}